{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02955","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得晖字 · 苏瓌","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得晖字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳早露曦，睿赏瞰秋矶。\n菊气先熏酒，萸香更袭衣。\n清切丝桐会，纵横文雅飞。\n恩深荅效浅，留醉奉宸晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏瓌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}